# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone WAN / interface ge1
#   zone LAN1 / interface ge3
#   zone LAN1 / interface ge4
#   zone DMZ / interface ge5
#   zone FWS_LAB / interface ge6
# Written inactive:
#   Alice_Workhours: schedule 'WORKHOURS' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; source user match alice is not converted
#   Country_Block: references 'COUNTRY_X': geography XX: not an address FWShift can read
#   Portal_Access: host name object PORTAL: the form of an address object of a host name is not in the documentation FWShift could read
#   VS_Only: not converted: ctmatch dnat: matches only connections that a virtual server translated
